-- wallet: Meta's official USD and INR rate cards, effective 1 October 2026
-- Why this migration exists: the first load of the two cards Meta publishes ("Cost per message in USD/INR on the WhatsApp
-- Business Platform, effective October 1, 2026"), so a fresh install starts from Meta's real list prices instead of the
-- indicative card bundled in code. The operator replaces them each quarter from the rates screen (Import Meta rate card);
-- the import upserts on (currency, market, category), so this seed is never re-applied over a newer card.

ON CONFLICT (currency, market, category) DO NOTHING;
